# Services that must never be touched by the packet filter
# (--hostlist-exclude/--ipset-exclude).
# Empty by default: the filter protects nothing unless you add entries.
# Your own entries belong in exc.user (extension UI: "Excluded domains")
# or in an optional profile list (see exc.default-template).
# One host per line.
#
# If a site breaks with desync strategies (e.g. it validates TLS/HTTP packet
# framing strictly), add its host here so the filter never touches it.
# Example:
# example.invalid
